    "group": "Monolith",
    "summary": "After battle round one, during your Movement phase, you may select a friendly NECRONS INFANTRY unit from the battlefield or Strategic Reserves. If on the battlefield, remove it and put it into Strategic Reserves. When it arrives from Strategic Reserves, place it wholly within 6″ of the Monolith and farther than 8″ from every enemy unit. This applies even inside the enemy deployment zone. The arriving unit is barred from Charge moves that turn.",
